## Fill in

`src/{{ module_name }}/__init__.py` ships a placeholder `parse` that reads the generated CSV fixture, so the contract test passes before you have written anything. Replace two things:

- `{{ class_name }}.parse`, with the `{{ name }}` format's own reader.
- `tests/fixtures/sample{{ suffix }}`, with a real recording small enough to commit.

